<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kiwi Income leases Majestic Centre to BIL.</title>
<headline>Kiwi Income leases Majestic Centre to BIL.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kiwi Income Property Trust said on Tuesday it had leased the remaining three floors in the Majestic Centre to Brierley Investment Ltd.</p>
<p>BIL will move its headquarters from the CML Building in the New Year.</p>
<p>Kiwi Income said it had also made significant inroads into leasing vacant space in the Price Waterhouse Centre in Christchurch by letting two floors.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
